== Effects ==
* {{dlc|nr}} x2 [[range]].
* {{dlc|r}} +3 [[range]].
* {{dlc|nr}} x0.5 [[tear falling speed]].

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} This trinket has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Pin}}, {{e|Larry Jr.}}, {{e|The Hollow}} or {{e|Scolex}}.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Mom's Box|nr}}: Quadruples the range.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: Having either increases [[range]] by 6. Having both by 9.

== Interactions ==
* {{C|Azazel|nr}}: Increases the laser's range, but doesn't double it.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: Shot bombs are very fast.
* {{i|Incubus|nr}} / {{i|Fate's Reward}}: Only tear falling speed affects their shots, usually lowering effective range.
* {{i|Ipecac|nr}}: Reduces the effective range of shots, as they fall faster.

